{"id":"ee8677f552ac477b","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-ck.md","title":"Church–Kleene 序数","display":"df-ck — Church–Kleene 序数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-ck","aliases":["20-df-ck"],"display":"df-ck — Church–Kleene 序数","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.hyperarithmetic","source_kind":"legacy-supplement","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"既有条目的集合论定义修复；书外补充","depends_on":["[[20-df-computable-wellorder]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-ck"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-ck</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ck — Church–Kleene 序数"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.hyperarithmetic"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"legacy-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"既有条目的集合论定义修复；书外补充"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1425fc4773bfa69c\" href=\"?note=1425fc4773bfa69c\" title=\"20-df-computable-wellorder\">20-df-computable-wellorder</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> 为第一不可数序数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(D\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\omega^2\">\\(R\\subseteq\\omega^2\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{otp}\">\\(\\operatorname{otp}\\)</span> 仅在其良序定义域上使用；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RecOrd}\">\\(\\operatorname{RecOrd}\\)</span> 在下文作为有界集合定义，而非未给出载体的类缩写。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1425fc4773bfa69c\" href=\"?note=1425fc4773bfa69c\" title=\"20-df-computable-wellorder\">20-df-computable-wellorder</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ck}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathscr W_{\\mathrm{comp}}:=\\{(D,R)\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\times\\mathcal P(\\omega^2):\n\\operatorname{CWO}(D,R)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{RecOrd}:=\\{\\alpha\\in\\omega_1:\n\\exists(D,R)\\in\\mathscr W_{\\mathrm{comp}}\\ [\\operatorname{otp}(D,R)=\\alpha]\\},\\\\\n\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}:=\\sup\\operatorname{RecOrd}=\\bigcup\\operatorname{RecOrd}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ck}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathscr W_{\\mathrm{comp}}:=\\{(D,R)\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\times\\mathcal P(\\omega^2):\n\\operatorname{CWO}(D,R)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{RecOrd}:=\\{\\alpha\\in\\omega_1:\n\\exists(D,R)\\in\\mathscr W_{\\mathrm{comp}}\\ [\\operatorname{otp}(D,R)=\\alpha]\\},\\\\\n\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}:=\\sup\\operatorname{RecOrd}=\\bigcup\\operatorname{RecOrd}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>把原 Hypothesis 中的 RecOrd 缩写移入形式定义，并显式给出可计算良序对的集合载体。序型只在可计算良序上取值；由于这些载体都是自然数子集，其序型落在 ω₁ 内。仍包含有限载体及空载体，没有改成仅对 ω 上的无限良序取上确界。</p>\n<p>来源：既有条目的集合论定义修复；书外补充。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-computable-wellorder","status":"resolved","id":"1425fc4773bfa69c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable-wellorder]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable-wellorder","status":"resolved","id":"1425fc4773bfa69c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-wellorder]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"D\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\omega^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{otp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RecOrd}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ck}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathscr W_{\\mathrm{comp}}:=\\{(D,R)\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\times\\mathcal P(\\omega^2):\n\\operatorname{CWO}(D,R)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{RecOrd}:=\\{\\alpha\\in\\omega_1:\n\\exists(D,R)\\in\\mathscr W_{\\mathrm{comp}}\\ [\\operatorname{otp}(D,R)=\\alpha]\\},\\\\\n\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}:=\\sup\\operatorname{RecOrd}=\\bigcup\\operatorname{RecOrd}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1577,"backlinks":[{"id":"a6caa184e5759034","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-ck]]；see [[20-df-computable-wellorder]]；see [[20-df-anal]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-442","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-ck]] — 章 supplement；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-442","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-ck]]"}],"outgoing":["1425fc4773bfa69c"]}